{"test": "rebindLockedFollowing", "follow_doc": "rebinding moves the follow edge to the slot's current referent.", "follow_body": "parent.ref = other;
            locked(() -> OWNER.method("rebindLocked", "State,int,boolean").invoke(parentState, slot, false));
            assertEquals(0, (int) STATE.field("parentCount").get(childState), "the old child is released");
            assertSame(state(other), ((Object[]) STATE.field("children").get(parentState))[slot]);
            assertEquals(1, (int) STATE.field("parentCount").get(state(other)));"}
